# Bots inherit env from the repo root .env via dotenv walking up.
# See ../.env.example for the canonical key list.
#
# Required per bot (referenced by individual scripts):
#   BOT_RANDOM_PRIVATE_KEY     → random.ts
#   BOT_ARB_PRIVATE_KEY        → naive-arb.ts
#   BOT_SANDWICH_PRIVATE_KEY   → naive-sandwich.ts
#   BOT_LIQ_PRIVATE_KEY        → liquidator.ts
#   BOT_JIT_PRIVATE_KEY        → jit-lp.ts
#   BOT_WHALE_PRIVATE_KEY      → whale-watch.ts
#
# Optional:
#   BOT_MODE=mock              # mock | live
#   COORDINATOR_WS=ws://localhost:3001/searcher
#   LOG_LEVEL=info
